<!--
A map of the trade flows between the reporter and a set of partners: one curved arrow per flow,
imports (partner -> reporter) in blue, exports (reporter -> partner) in orange, width proportional
to the value, label = value and share of the reporter's world total. Hover an arrow for the details.
Usage: rmarkdown::render("flow_map_LU.Rmd", envir = globalenv()) with final_df in memory, or Knit with
final_df.rds next to the file. Change params$partners to draw other countries (e.g. the top 10).
The base map is fetched from cdn.plot.ly when the page opens, unless params$topojson_url is set.
-->

